flowchart TD
    S0["0 · Setup & Book Brief<br/>languages, genre, tone, options"] --> S1
    S1["1 · Open & unpack<br/>unzip EPUB / read FB2 / detect real language / refuse DRM"] --> S2
    S2["2 · Read structure into a tree<br/>pull out text segments, protect tags/code/images/links"] --> S3
    S3["3 · Names pass (Prep)<br/>scan groups forms under one name, model reads names and what it knows of them,<br/>suggests targets, checks them (offline fallback: frequency + casing)"] --> S4
    S4["4 · Translate loop<br/>chunk by chunk, with context"] --> S5
    S5["5 · Auto-check<br/>accept if no check blocks; one repair for what fails, kept only if never worse"] --> S6
    S6{"More chunks / chapters?"}
    S6 -- yes --> S4
    S6 -- no --> PR["6 · Proofread stage (every dial)<br/>audit · term sweep · deferrals settled by code · mark list<br/>Balanced/Max: one minimal-edit call per marked window, never-worse gate<br/>Max: round 2 over every story paragraph · Fast: no model call"]
    PR --> S7["7 · Put text back into the tree<br/>images/fonts/IDs untouched, update language tags"]
    S7 --> S8["8 · Repackage<br/>EPUB (mimetype-first) / FB2 / MD / TXT"]
    S8 --> DONE(["Translated book saved"])
    S5 -. " failing segments (rare) " .-> Q["Flagged segments<br/>(optional human look)"]
    S5 -. " deferrals and marks<br/>(facts revealed later) " .-> PR
    PR -. " Fast marks, proposals,<br/>kept rewrites (Undo proofread) " .-> Q
    S8 --> Q
